  "limits_and_remaining_work": [
    "Stable object identity is not full accepted-recovery metadata validation. Restored bytes/mtime with the same object, permission/link/ownership changes, application-owned metadata transitions and filesystem behavior without persistent birth identity need further policy and evidence before live review-bearing execution is enabled.",
    "The live begin endpoint continues to reject LanguageReview; the editor still submits None and uses its existing pre-intent validation. Shared UI evidence and fresh authority plus installed review-bearing interruption/process-kill recovery remain unfinished.",
    "Windows all-target cross-compilation checks the new identity fields and adapter build only. It does not establish native Windows event, filesystem, resource-recovery or process-cleanup behavior.",
    "This matrix includes strict target checks, native libraries, the full bridge library suite and selected browser modules. It is not the final complete pre-push integration/browser/editor/font/real-server suite. Both listed existing ignored tests remain unexecuted.",
    "Complete writer/child/cross-process exclusion, retained/in-flight memory and runtime-output budgets, reusable-result keys and measured optional prefetch, Terraform public SDK/toolkit publication, exact-head CI/nightly publication and cleanup remain unfinished. Editor performance is parked."
  ]
